    {
      "type": "lead",
      "text": "打开 `*.airp.json` 默认进入 **渲染视图**（Custom Editor）；需要时 **Edit Source** 打开源文档。命令与文案只用 Renderer / 渲染视图；全仓禁止 Preview 字样。",
      "@id": "2ui841jahj"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "最终形态",
      "lead": "结论先于细节。",
      "@id": "n9smhtrimd",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "keyValueList",
          "layout": "stacked",
          "items": [
            {
              "key": "默认打开",
              "value": "`customEditors` + `CustomReadonlyEditorProvider`；`priority` 为 default，打开即渲染视图",
              "@id": "cwnmg24nb0"
            },
            {
              "key": "源文档",
              "value": "Edit Source / Open With → Text Editor；需要时 Beside 并排",
              "@id": "nzsdz0dqn8"
            },
            {
              "key": "命令",
              "value": "`airp.renderer.open`（Open Renderer）；`airp.renderer.editSource`（Edit Source）",
              "@id": "q3npxus4lu"
            },
            {
              "key": "源码优先",
              "value": "用户用 `workbench.editorAssociations` 将 `*.airp.json` 关联到默认文本编辑器；不另造扩展设置",
              "@id": "39hylj90fc"
            },
            {
              "key": "实现落点",
              "value": "`apps/renderer-vscode`；复用 `RenderSession` / Worker / watch / export",
              "@id": "p2br1usxe7"
            }
          ],
          "@id": "d2nic90i6p"
        },
        {
          "type": "decision",
          "title": "默认打开方式",
          "chosen": "Custom Editor 默认渲染视图",
          "rationale": "主产物是阅读结果；打开即见渲染。源文档经 Edit Source / Open With 可达。不另做自动双栏打开。",
          "status": "accepted",
          "@id": "lwid7qaq4m"
        },
        {
          "type": "constraint",
